{"seq":2,"slug":"universal-links-app-links","title":"Universal Links 与 App Links","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/universal-links-app-links","wordCount":1047,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"universal-links-与-app-links\">Universal Links 与 App Links</h1><p>Universal Links（iOS）和 Android App Links 是目前最安全可靠的深链方案，两者都以标准 HTTPS URL 为载体，通过服务器托管验证文件将域名与 App 绑定。本文深入两套机制的配置细节、验证流程和常见陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>AASA（Apple App Site Association）</strong>：托管在 <code>https://domain/.well-known/apple-app-site-association</code> 的 JSON 文件，声明哪些路径由哪个 App（通过 Team ID + Bundle ID）处理，Apple CDN 在 App 安装时拉取并缓存</li>\n<li><strong>Digital Asset Links（DAL）</strong>：Android 的域名验证机制，<code>assetlinks.json</code> 中的 SHA-256 指纹必须与 App 签名证书精确匹配，<code>autoVerify=true</code> 触发安装时自动验证</li>\n<li><strong>域名与 App 的双向绑定</strong>：iOS 通过 Entitlements 中的 <code>com.apple.developer.associated-domains</code> 声明 App 期望处理哪些域名，服务器通过 AASA 授权 App 处理请求，两者缺一不可</li>\n<li><strong>降级行为</strong>：Universal Links 和 App Links 在 App 未安装或验证失败时都会降级到普通 HTTPS 链接（浏览器打开），不产生错误提示</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"apple-app-site-association-aasa-配置\">Apple App Site Association（AASA）配置</h2><p>AASA 是 iOS Universal Links 的核心配置文件，告诉 Apple 服务器哪些 URL 路径应该路由到哪个 App。</p>\n<h3 id=\"文件格式-ios-9-12-旧格式\">文件格式（iOS 9–12，旧格式）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;applinks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;apps&quot;: [],&#10;    &quot;details&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;appID&quot;: &quot;TEAMID.com.example.app&quot;,&#10;        &quot;paths&quot;: [&quot;/product/*&quot;, &quot;/user/profile&quot;, &quot;NOT /admin/*&quot;]&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"applinks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"apps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"details\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"appID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TEAMID.com.example.app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/user/profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NOT /admin/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"文件格式-ios-13-新格式\">文件格式（iOS 13+，新格式）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;applinks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;details&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;appIDs&quot;: [&quot;TEAMID.com.example.app&quot;, &quot;TEAMID.com.example.app.beta&quot;],&#10;        &quot;components&quot;: [&#10;          {&#10;            &quot;/&quot;: &quot;/product/*&quot;,&#10;            &quot;comment&quot;: &quot;产品详情页&quot;&#10;          },&#10;          {&#10;            &quot;/&quot;: &quot;/user/profile&quot;,&#10;            &quot;?&quot;: { &quot;tab&quot;: &quot;?*&quot; },&#10;            &quot;comment&quot;: &quot;带 tab 参数的用户主页&quot;&#10;          },&#10;          {&#10;            &quot;/&quot;: &quot;/admin/*&quot;,&#10;            &quot;exclude&quot;: true,&#10;            &quot;comment&quot;: &quot;管理后台不走 Universal Links&quot;&#10;          }&#10;        ]&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"applinks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"details\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"appIDs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TEAMID.com.example.app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TEAMID.com.example.app.beta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"components\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"comment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"产品详情页\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/user/profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"?\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tab\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"?*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"comment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"带 tab 参数的用户主页\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/admin/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"exclude\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"comment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"管理后台不走 Universal Links\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>新格式的 <code>components</code> 数组支持更精细的路径匹配，<code>?</code> 字段可以匹配特定查询参数，<code>exclude: true</code> 排除某些路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"aasa-托管要求\">AASA 托管要求</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>URL 路径</td>\n<td><code>https://example.com/.well-known/apple-app-site-association</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type</td>\n<td><code>application/json</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTPS</td>\n<td>必须，证书有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重定向</td>\n<td>禁止（Apple 不跟随重定向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问限制</td>\n<td>不能要求认证，Apple CDN 必须能直接访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDN 缓存</td>\n<td>Apple 通过自有 CDN 缓存，设备安装/更新 App 时拉取</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"app-端-entitlements-配置\">App 端 Entitlements 配置</h3><p>Xcode 中需要在 <code>&lt;AppName&gt;.entitlements</code> 文件添加 <code>com.apple.developer.associated-domains</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;key&gt;com.apple.developer.associated-domains&lt;/key&gt;&#10;&lt;array&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;applinks:example.com&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;applinks:www.example.com&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;applinks:*.example.com&lt;/string&gt;&#10;&lt;/array&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.apple.developer.associated-domains&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>applinks:example.com&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>applinks:www.example.com&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>applinks:*.example.com&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：<code>applinks:</code> 前缀不能有 <code>https://</code>，通配符 <code>*</code> 只匹配单级子域名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-universal-links-的验证与缓存机制\">iOS Universal Links 的验证与缓存机制</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Apple as Apple CDN&#10;    participant Server as 开发者服务器&#10;    participant iOS as iOS 系统&#10;    participant App as 目标 App&#10;&#10;    Note over iOS: App 安装或 Entitlements 变更时&#10;    iOS-&gt;&gt;Apple: 请求 AASA(通过 Apple CDN 代理)&#10;    Apple-&gt;&gt;Server: 回源拉取 AASA&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Apple: 返回 AASA JSON&#10;    Apple-&gt;&gt;iOS: 分发 AASA&#10;    iOS-&gt;&gt;iOS: 缓存绑定关系&#10;&#10;    Note over iOS,App: 用户点击 https://example.com/product/123&#10;    iOS-&gt;&gt;iOS: 检查域名是否在绑定关系中&#10;    iOS-&gt;&gt;iOS: 检查 App 是否已安装&#10;    iOS-&gt;&gt;App: universal-links-supported,调用 App&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析 NSUserActivity.webpageURL\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Apple as Apple CDN\n    participant Server as 开发者服务器\n    participant iOS as iOS 系统\n    participant App as 目标 App\n\n    Note over iOS: App 安装或 Entitlements 变更时\n    iOS-&gt;&gt;Apple: 请求 AASA(通过 Apple CDN 代理)\n    Apple-&gt;&gt;Server: 回源拉取 AASA\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Apple: 返回 AASA JSON\n    Apple-&gt;&gt;iOS: 分发 AASA\n    iOS-&gt;&gt;iOS: 缓存绑定关系\n\n    Note over iOS,App: 用户点击 https://example.com/product/123\n    iOS-&gt;&gt;iOS: 检查域名是否在绑定关系中\n    iOS-&gt;&gt;iOS: 检查 App 是否已安装\n    iOS-&gt;&gt;App: universal-links-supported,调用 App\n    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析 NSUserActivity.webpageURL</pre><p><strong>关键注意点：</strong> Apple 代理访问 AASA 的 IP 属于 <code>17.0.0.0/8</code> 网段，服务器防火墙不能屏蔽这个范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nsuseractivity-处理\">NSUserActivity 处理</h2><p>App 收到 Universal Link 时，UIApplicationDelegate 或 SceneDelegate 会收到 <code>NSUserActivity</code>，而不是直接的 URL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// UIApplicationDelegate 方式（旧版）&#10;func application(_ application: UIApplication,&#10;                 continue userActivity: NSUserActivity,&#10;                 restorationHandler: @escaping ([UIUserActivityRestoring]?) -&gt; Void) -&gt; Bool {&#10;    guard userActivity.activityType == NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb,&#10;          let url = userActivity.webpageURL else {&#10;        return false&#10;    }&#10;    return handleDeepLink(url)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// SceneDelegate 方式（iOS 13+）&#10;func scene(_ scene: UIScene, continue userActivity: NSUserActivity) {&#10;    guard let url = userActivity.webpageURL else { return }&#10;    handleDeepLink(url)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// UIApplicationDelegate 方式（旧版）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> application: UIApplication,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                 continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity: NSUserActivity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                 restorationHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ([UIUserActivityRestoring]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity.activityType </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity.webpageURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> handleDeepLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SceneDelegate 方式（iOS 13+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> scene</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scene: UIScene, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity: NSUserActivity) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userActivity.webpageURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    handleDeepLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"android-digital-asset-links-dal-配置\">Android Digital Asset Links（DAL）配置</h2><h3 id=\"assetlinks-json-格式\">assetlinks.json 格式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"[&#10;  {&#10;    &quot;relation&quot;: [&quot;delegate_permission/common.handle_all_urls&quot;],&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;android_app&quot;,&#10;      &quot;package_name&quot;: &quot;com.example.app&quot;,&#10;      &quot;sha256_cert_fingerprints&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;14:6D:E9:83:C5:73:06:50:D8:EE:B9:95:2F:34:FC:64:16:A0:83:42:E6:1D:BE:A8:8A:04:96:B2:3F:CF:44:E5&quot;&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"relation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delegate_permission/common.handle_all_urls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android_app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"package_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sha256_cert_fingerprints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"14:6D:E9:83:C5:73:06:50:D8:EE:B9:95:2F:34:FC:64:16:A0:83:42:E6:1D:BE:A8:8A:04:96:B2:3F:CF:44:E5\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sha256_cert_fingerprints</code> 可以包含多个指纹，以支持不同签名的构建版本（调试 / 发布 / Play 应用签名）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"获取-sha-256-指纹\">获取 SHA-256 指纹</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 从 keystore 获取&#10;keytool -list -v -keystore release.keystore -alias key0&#10;&#10;# 从 APK 获取&#10;apksigner verify --print-certs app-release.apk&#10;&#10;# 从 Play Console 获取（Play 应用签名）&#10;# 进入 Setup &gt; App signing，查看&quot;App signing key certificate&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 keystore 获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keytool</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -list</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -keystore</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release.keystore</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -alias</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> key0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 APK 获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apksigner</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> verify</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --print-certs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-release.apk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 Play Console 获取（Play 应用签名）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 进入 Setup > App signing，查看\"App signing key certificate\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"assetlinks-json-托管要求\">assetlinks.json 托管要求</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>URL 路径</td>\n<td><code>https://example.com/.well-known/assetlinks.json</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type</td>\n<td><code>application/json</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTPS</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重定向</td>\n<td>禁止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问限制</td>\n<td>Google 验证服务器必须能直接访问</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"androidmanifest-xml-配置\">AndroidManifest.xml 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;activity android:name=&quot;.ProductDetailActivity&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;intent-filter android:autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.intent.action.VIEW&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.DEFAULT&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.BROWSABLE&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;data&#10;            android:scheme=&quot;https&quot;&#10;            android:host=&quot;example.com&quot;&#10;            android:pathPrefix=&quot;/product&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;&#10;&lt;/activity&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".ProductDetailActivity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:autoVerify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.action.VIEW\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.DEFAULT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.BROWSABLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:pathPrefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>android:autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;</code> 是启用 App Links 自动验证的关键属性，Android 安装 App 时会自动向域名请求 <code>assetlinks.json</code> 进行验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"android-app-links-的验证流程\">Android App Links 的验证流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Store as App Store / 侧载&#10;    participant Android as Android 系统&#10;    participant Server as 开发者服务器&#10;    participant App as 目标 App&#10;&#10;    Note over Android: App 安装时(autoVerify=true)&#10;    Android-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /.well-known/assetlinks.json&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Android: 返回 DAL JSON&#10;    Android-&gt;&gt;Android: 验证包名 + 证书指纹&#10;    Android-&gt;&gt;Android: 标记域名为&quot;已验证&quot;&#10;&#10;    Note over Android,App: 用户点击 https://example.com/product/123&#10;    Android-&gt;&gt;Android: 检查域名是否已验证&#10;    Android-&gt;&gt;App: 直接打开,无选择器弹窗&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析 Intent 数据\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Store as App Store / 侧载\n    participant Android as Android 系统\n    participant Server as 开发者服务器\n    participant App as 目标 App\n\n    Note over Android: App 安装时(autoVerify=true)\n    Android-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /.well-known/assetlinks.json\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Android: 返回 DAL JSON\n    Android-&gt;&gt;Android: 验证包名 + 证书指纹\n    Android-&gt;&gt;Android: 标记域名为\"已验证\"\n\n    Note over Android,App: 用户点击 https://example.com/product/123\n    Android-&gt;&gt;Android: 检查域名是否已验证\n    Android-&gt;&gt;App: 直接打开,无选择器弹窗\n    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析 Intent 数据</pre><p>验证失败的 App Links 会退化为普通 HTTPS 链接（在浏览器中打开）或触发 App 选择器，不会产生硬性错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见配置错误排查\">常见配置错误排查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误现象</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n<th>排查方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS Universal Links 不触发</td>\n<td>AASA 未能被 Apple CDN 拉取</td>\n<td><code>aasa-validator.com</code> 或 <code>branch.io/resources/aasa-validator</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App Links 弹出选择器</td>\n<td>域名验证失败</td>\n<td><code>adb shell pm get-app-links --user 0 com.example.app</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AASA 解析错误</td>\n<td>JSON 格式不合法</td>\n<td>Apple 提供的 App Search API 验证工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证书指纹不匹配</td>\n<td>签名版本不一致</td>\n<td>确认 Play 应用签名页面的指纹是否已加入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只有部分路径生效</td>\n<td>AASA components 配置错误</td>\n<td>检查 <code>exclude</code> 规则的优先级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多-app-子域名与-wildcard\">多 App、子域名与 Wildcard</h2><p>Universal Links 支持 <code>applinks:*.example.com</code> 通配符，但不支持多级通配（<code>applinks:*.*.example.com</code> 无效）。每个子域名都需要独立托管 AASA，或者在主域名的 AASA 中声明多个域名的路径规则。</p>\n<p>Android 支持在一个 <code>assetlinks.json</code> 中列出多个 App（多个 JSON 对象），也支持通过链接到其他域名的 <code>assetlinks.json</code>（<code>include</code> 指令）实现跨域名复用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Universal Links 和 App Links 通过域名验证机制消除了自定义 URI Scheme 的劫持风险，是生产级深链的首选方案。关键操作清单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>iOS：在 Xcode Entitlements 中添加 <code>applinks:</code> 域名，在服务器 <code>/.well-known/apple-app-site-association</code> 托管正确格式的 JSON</li>\n<li>Android：在 <code>intent-filter</code> 中设置 <code>android:autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;</code>，在 <code>/.well-known/assetlinks.json</code> 中包含 App 的 SHA-256 证书指纹</li>\n<li>调试：使用 <code>adb shell pm get-app-links</code> 检查 Android 验证状态，使用 AASA 验证工具检查 iOS 配置</li>\n<li>多环境：调试包和发布包有不同签名，需要在 <code>assetlinks.json</code> 中分别列出</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"deep-link-types-protocols\">深链类型与协议</a> 提供选型对比框架；<a href=\"custom-uri-scheme\">自定义 URI Scheme</a> 补充不需要服务器配置的轻量方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Universal Links 与 App Links","id":"universal-links-与-app-links"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Apple App Site Association（AASA）配置","id":"apple-app-site-association-aasa-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"文件格式（iOS 9–12，旧格式）","id":"文件格式-ios-9-12-旧格式"},{"level":3,"text":"文件格式（iOS 13+，新格式）","id":"文件格式-ios-13-新格式"},{"level":3,"text":"AASA 托管要求","id":"aasa-托管要求"},{"level":3,"text":"App 端 Entitlements 配置","id":"app-端-entitlements-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS Universal Links 的验证与缓存机制","id":"ios-universal-links-的验证与缓存机制"},{"level":2,"text":"NSUserActivity 处理","id":"nsuseractivity-处理"},{"level":2,"text":"Android Digital Asset Links（DAL）配置","id":"android-digital-asset-links-dal-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"assetlinks.json 格式","id":"assetlinks-json-格式"},{"level":3,"text":"获取 SHA-256 指纹","id":"获取-sha-256-指纹"},{"level":3,"text":"assetlinks.json 托管要求","id":"assetlinks-json-托管要求"},{"level":3,"text":"AndroidManifest.xml 配置","id":"androidmanifest-xml-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Android App Links 的验证流程","id":"android-app-links-的验证流程"},{"level":2,"text":"常见配置错误排查","id":"常见配置错误排查"},{"level":2,"text":"多 App、子域名与 Wildcard","id":"多-app-子域名与-wildcard"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"深链类型与协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/deep-link-types-protocols"},"next":{"title":"自定义 URI Scheme","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/custom-uri-scheme"}}